co&amp;rft.atitle=Decade&amp;rft.date=2020&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lexico.com%2Fdefinition%2Fdecade&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ADecade" class="Z3988" about="#mwt13" id="mwvg"></span></span></li>
